@startuml Sequence - Recovery Flow (NO_AVAILABILITY → REPLAN)
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title Sequence Diagram — Hero Recovery Scenario\nNO_AVAILABILITY → REPLAN → Zone B → SUCCESS

actor User
participant "React UI" as UI
participant "REST API" as API
participant "Task Scheduler" as Sched
participant "Prepare Action" as Prep
participant "Policy Engine" as Pol
participant "Executor" as Exec
participant "Tool Registry" as Reg
participant "Transport\nAdapter" as TransAdapt
participant "Transport\nService :8002" as TransSvc
participant "Recovery\nHandler" as Recov
participant "Replanner" as Replan
participant "TaskPlan\nValidator" as PlanVal
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Initial execution: T1, T2 COMPLETED ==
note over Sched
  Giả sử T1 (register_resident) và T2 (register_vehicle)
  đã COMPLETED. Đang thực hiện T3 (book_parking).
end note

== T3: book_parking(Zone A) → FAILURE ==
Sched -> Prep: T3: book_parking\n{resident_id, vehicle_id, zone: "A"}
Prep -> Pol: ProposedAction
Pol -> Exec: AUTO_ALLOWED
Exec -> Reg: execute("book_parking", params, key)
Reg -> TransAdapt: adapter_fn(params, idempotency_key)
TransAdapt -> TransSvc: POST /parking\n{zone: "A", ...}\nHeaders: Idempotency-Key

alt Force error injection (?force_error=NO_AVAILABILITY)
    TransSvc -> TransAdapt: {error: {code: "NO_AVAILABILITY",\nmessage: "No parking slot available in zone A",\nretryable: false}}
else Normal flow (no availability)
    TransSvc -> TransAdapt: {error: {code: "NO_AVAILABILITY", ...}}
end

TransAdapt -> Exec: StandardResult\n{success: false, error: {code: "NO_AVAILABILITY"}}
Exec -> DB: UPDATE step_results\nstatus=FAILED, error_code="NO_AVAILABILITY"
Exec -> Recov: failure signal\n{error_code, retryable, retry_count}

== Recovery Handler decides strategy ==
Recov -> Recov: lookup (error.code, retryable, retry_count)\n"NO_AVAILABILITY" + retryable=false → REPLAN
Recov -> DB: UPDATE flow_executions\nstatus=RECOVERING
Recov -> Replan: REPLAN signal\n{completed_steps: [T1, T2],\nfailed_step: T3,\nerror: "Zone A unavailable"}

== Replanner reasons semantically ==
Replan -> Replan: LLM reasoning:\n"Zone A hết chỗ → thử Zone B"\nGenerate new plan for remaining steps
Replan -> Replan: proposed replan:\n[T3': book_parking(zone="B"),\nT4': pay_fee]
Replan -> PlanVal: proposed replan
PlanVal -> PlanVal: validate schema\ncheck allowlist\ncheck cycle\n(same validation as initial plan)
PlanVal -> Sched: validated replan
Sched -> DB: UPDATE flow_executions\nstatus=RUNNING

== Continue with T3': book_parking(Zone B) ==
Sched -> Prep: T3': book_parking\n{resident_id, vehicle_id, zone: "B"}
Prep -> Pol: ProposedAction
Pol -> Exec: AUTO_ALLOWED
Exec -> Reg: execute("book_parking", params, key)
Reg -> TransAdapt: adapter_fn(params, new_idempotency_key)
TransAdapt -> TransSvc: POST /parking\n{zone: "B", ...}\nHeaders: Idempotency-Key
TransSvc -> TransAdapt: {booking_id: "PKG-045",\nzone: "B", monthly_fee: 800000}
TransAdapt -> TransAdapt: normalize → StandardResult
TransAdapt -> Exec: StandardResult\n{success: true, transaction_id: "PKG-045",\ndata: {zone: "B", fee: 800000}}
Exec -> DB: INSERT step_results (T3')\nstatus=COMPLETED
Exec -> UI: emit state-change event
UI -> UI: show T3' COMPLETED\n(zone B, fee 800k)

== T4': pay_fee → SUCCESS ==
Exec -> Sched: success → next task
Sched -> Prep: T4': pay_fee\n{amount: 800000, booking_id: "PKG-045"}
Prep -> Pol: ProposedAction\n{action_type: "PAYMENT",\namount: 800000}
Pol -> Pol: check rules:\nR3: PAYMENT ≥ 300k → REQUIRES_APPROVAL
Pol -> UI: push ProposedAction via WebSocket
UI -> User: show approval modal\n"Thanh toán 800,000 VND cho phí đậu xe?"
User -> UI: approve
UI -> API: POST /flows/{id}/respond\n{approved: true}
API -> Exec: approved
Exec -> Reg: execute("pay_fee", params, key)
Reg -> TransAdapt: (skip - not transport)
note right: Actually calls Payment Adapter
Reg -> TransAdapt: adapter_fn(params, key)
TransAdapt -> TransSvc: (skip)
note right: Actually calls Payment Service :8003
TransAdapt -> Exec: (skip)
note right: Actually Payment Adapter
Exec -> Reg: (corrected flow)
Reg -> TransAdapt: (not used for pay_fee)
note over Reg
  Correct path:
  Executor → Registry → Payment Adapter → Payment Service
end note
Exec -> Sched: success → no more tasks

== Workflow complete ==
Sched -> DB: UPDATE flow_executions\nstatus=COMPLETED
Sched -> UI: emit workflow COMPLETED event
UI -> User: show success summary\n"Tất cả 4 bước hoàn thành\n(1 bước replan từ Zone A → Zone B)"

note over Exec, TransSvc
  **Key points:**
  • T1, T2 không bị chạy lại (đã COMPLETED)
  • T3 fail → REPLAN (không phải RETRY vì retryable=false)
  • T3' thành công với zone B
  • T4 yêu cầu HITL approval (amount ≥ 300k)
  • Idempotency key khác nhau cho T3 và T3'
end note

@enduml
